# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
$ABI strict
$Module cookie_handoff 3 "Request-owned response cookie handoff"
$Event cookie_event

$Function VOID reset(PRIV_TASK)
$Restrict vcl_recv

Discard request state before a new receive attempt, including restart to a HIT.

$Function STRING open(PRIV_TASK)
$Restrict vcl_miss

Allocate a handoff owned by this client task, including task-finalization cleanup.

$Function VOID bind(PRIV_TASK, STRING key)
$Restrict vcl_backend_fetch

Bind the backend task before removing the internal key from the origin request.

$Function VOID discard(PRIV_TASK)
$Restrict vcl_backend_error

Discard fields belonging to an abandoned backend response.

$Function BOOL detach(PRIV_TASK, STRING rules, BOOL background = 0)
$Restrict vcl_backend_response

Detach complete Set-Cookie fields only when every name has the Shared action.
Rules are ordered action TAB kind TAB literal-name LF, generated by the same
resolver used for request cookies. Personal values never enter the cache object.

$Function VOID deliver(PRIV_TASK)
$Restrict vcl_deliver

Append the original fields to their owning client response only.

$Function INT pending()

Number of live handoffs, for lifecycle verification (never cookie contents).

$Function STRING session_state(STRING socket_path, STRING site, STRING path, STRING cookie, DURATION timeout)
$Restrict vcl_recv

Query the root-owned local CMS session resolver before cache lookup. The result
contains only guest/private/unresolved and a fixed diagnostic, never session
values. Timeout comes from the hosting adapter's native connection allowance.

$Function VOID guard_joomla_forms(PRIV_TASK)
$Restrict vcl_backend_response

Inspect actual Joomla session-token HTML before allocating a shared object.
Public JSON token fields use a private ESI include. Actual session forms remain
uncached origin responses. There is no body-size inspection cutoff.

$Function BOOL prepare_token(PRIV_TASK, PRIV_TOP)
$Restrict vcl_deliver

Prepare the requesting visitor's token before ESI composition and headers.

$Function STRING csrf_token(PRIV_TOP)
$Restrict vcl_synth

Return only the top request's private token for its internal ESI fragment.

$Function BOOL ensure_token(PRIV_TASK, PRIV_TOP, STRING socket_path, STRING site, STRING path, STRING cookie, STRING host, STRING scheme, STRING user_agent, STRING client_ip, DURATION timeout)
$Restrict vcl_hit vcl_deliver

Obtain a real origin-issued session/token for this visitor. On failure the VCL
falls back to the original uncached response before delivering any template.

$Function STRING token_reason(PRIV_TASK)

Fixed diagnostic for an unavailable/private token, without values.
